sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User / event
 participant S as Supervisor
 participant D as SQLite owner
 participant B as Tool broker
 participant T as Target
 rect rgb(244, 248, 252)
 Note over U,T: Approval completes a saved operation
 U->>D: Approve exact proposal revision
 D->>D: Commit decision and deduplicated wakeup
 D-->>B: Durable work available
 B->>D: Recheck root, owner, proposal and resources
 alt Root paused or proposal stale
 D-->>B: Blocked or revision conflict
 Note over S,B: Retain approval and wait - no dispatch
 else Eligible now
 D->>D: Consume approval and admit same operation
 D-->>B: Current attempt admitted
 B->>T: Dispatch saved arguments
 T-->>B: Actual outcome
 B->>D: Persist outcome and session event
 D-->>S: New outcome at next valid turn boundary
 end
 end
 rect rgb(255, 250, 239)
 Note over U,T: Redirect is independent of Pause
 U->>D: Redirect affected scope
 D->>D: Save instruction and fence old pending dispatch
 D-->>U: Received receipt
 D-->>S: New instruction revision
 S->>B: Cancel affected in-flight work
 B->>T: Contract-specific cancellation
 T-->>B: Known result or uncertain effect
 B->>D: Preserve observations and scoped blockers
 S->>D: Acknowledge at safe context boundary
 S->>D: Record incorporated assignment / plan
 Note over S,T: Eligible independent work continues automatically
 end
